    "If you've never prayed it, start here. Almost everyone gets stuck on the mechanics, not the faith.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you've never prayed it, start here. Almost everyone gets stuck on the mechanics, not the faith."
